《战国策》：秦伐蒲，蒲人恐，请胡衍救蒲，衍说鄠里子解去。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","人事","权争"],"content":"1秦昭王使向壽平宜陽，而使樗里子、甘茂伐魏。甘茂言於王，以武遂復歸之韓。向壽、公孫奭爭之，不能得，由此怨讒甘茂。茂懼，輟伐魏蒲阪，亡去。樗里子與魏講而罷兵。甘茂奔齊。","content_fanyi":"秦昭襄王派向寿去平抚宜阳，又命樗里子、甘茂攻打魏国。甘茂向秦昭襄王进言，建议把武遂重新归还给韩国。向寿和公孙奭为此争执，未能如愿，因此怨恨甘茂，进谗言诋毁他。甘茂害怕，停止攻打魏国蒲阪，逃亡出走。樗里子只好同魏国讲和，撤回军队。甘茂投奔齐国。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦昭王使向寿平宜阳，而使樗里子、甘茂伐魏。甘茂言于王，以武遂复归之韩。向寿、公孙奭争之，不能得，由此怨谗甘茂。茂惧，辍伐魏蒲阪，亡去。樗里子与魏讲而罢兵。甘茂奔齐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":270,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9be-db0e-11ef-b8b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"派遣使者联络列国以巩固扩张成果","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8C7CD9F0DB0E11EF98C2A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"衡漳水","place_name_jianti_auto":"衡漳水","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f2-db0e-11ef-a94d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"歷下","place_name_jianti_auto":"历下","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f3-db0e-11ef-b9de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博城","place_name_jianti_auto":"博城","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f4-db0e-11ef-8135-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂鄕縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐鄕县","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f5-db0e-11ef-94e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"葭水","place_name_jianti_auto":"葭水","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f6-db0e-11ef-9606-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"水經註：衡漳水東北歷下博城西，又西逕樂鄕縣故城南，又東引葭水注之。葭，音加。","note_content_jianti_auto":"水经注：衡漳水东北历下博城西，又西迳乐鄕县故城南，又东引葭水注之。葭，音加。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f1-db0e-11ef-ada9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragrap