311,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda29-db0e-11ef-a6bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"勝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"胜州","start_index":320,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda2a-db0e-11ef-9738-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆林郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆林郡","start_index":322,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda2b-db0e-11ef-9f7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":327,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda2c-db0e-11ef-bd20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆林塞","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆林塞","start_index":328,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda2d-db0e-11ef-98fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"水經註：諸次水出上郡諸次山，其水東逕榆林塞，世又謂之榆林山，卽漢書所謂「榆溪舊塞」者。自溪西去，悉榆柳之藪，緣歷沙陵，屆龜茲縣西出，故云廣長榆也。王恢曰「樹榆爲塞」，謂此。蘇林以爲榆中在上郡，非也。按始皇本紀：西北逐匈奴，自榆中並河以東，屬之陰山。然榆中在金城東五十許里，陰山在朔方東，以此推之，不得在上郡。余謂蘇林之說固未爲盡，而道元所謂榆中在金城東五十許里亦非也。據衞青取河南地，案榆溪舊塞，正在唐麟、勝二州界，其西則接古上郡之境。況諸次水出上郡，逕榆林塞入河，則榆中在上郡之東明矣，諸次水無西流至金城、榆中之理。夷考其故，道元特以班志金城郡有榆中縣，遂牽合以爲說，不知此一節之誤尤甚於蘇林也。史記正義曰：榆中，勝州北河北岸也。杜佑曰：勝州榆林郡南卽秦榆林塞。","note_content_jianti_auto":"水经注：诸次水出上郡诸次山，其水东迳榆林塞，世又谓之榆林山，即汉书所谓「榆溪旧塞」者。自溪西去，悉榆柳之薮，缘历沙陵，届龟兹县西出，故云广长榆也。王恢曰「树榆为塞」，谓此。苏林以为榆中在上郡，非也。按始皇本纪：西北逐匈奴，自榆中并河以东，属之阴山。然榆中在金城东五十许里，阴山在朔方东，以此推之，不得在上郡。余谓苏林之说固未为尽，而道元所谓榆中在金城东五十许里亦非也。据衞青取河南地，案榆溪旧塞，正在唐麟、胜二州界，其西则接古上郡之境。况诸次水出上郡，迳榆林塞入河，则榆中在上郡之东明矣，诸次水无西流至金城、榆中之理。夷考其故，道元特以班志金城郡有榆中县，遂牵合以为说，不知此一节之误尤甚于苏林也。史记正义曰：榆中，胜州北河北岸也。杜佑曰：胜州榆林郡南即秦榆林塞。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f8-db0e-11ef-8e13-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda34-db0e-11ef-8995-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"林胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"林胡","place_note":"内蒙毛乌素沙漠东","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda35-db0e-11ef-a2fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"儋林","place_name_jianti_auto":"儋林","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda36-db0e-11ef-93cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"胡","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda37-db0e-11ef-bc55-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"林胡","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda38-db0e-11ef-88a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如淳曰：林胡，卽儋林。余謂此胡種落依阻林薄，因曰林胡。儋，都甘翻。種，章勇翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如淳曰：林胡，即儋林。余谓此胡种落依阻林薄，因曰林胡。儋，都甘翻。种，章勇翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda33-db0e-11ef-b200-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵王","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3a-db0e-11ef-979a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仇","people_name_jianti_auto":"仇","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3b-db0e-11ef-9d1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仇牧","people_name_jianti_auto":"仇牧","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3c-db0e-11ef-be05-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3d-db0e-11ef-bd4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"離","people_name_jianti_auto":"离","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3e-db0e-11ef-ac2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"翦","people_name_jianti_auto":"翦","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda3f-db0e-11ef-8650-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"離父","people_name_jianti_auto":"离父","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda40-db0e-11ef-a564-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"翦子","people_name_jianti_auto":"翦子","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda41-db0e-11ef-8d8f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王賁","people_name_jianti_auto":"王贲","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda42-db0e-11ef-a721-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda43-db0e-11ef-b1da-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"中山","place_name_jianti_auto":"中山","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c7cda44-db0e-11ef-b9a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_nam