aph_tongjian_id":"421bfdeb-6986-5b88-83f8-7ccd5925d9c2","source_start_index":100,"source_text":"《史记》赵武灵王二十年，略中山地，至宁葭。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/四、真定府（卷十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又苏厉为齐遗赵惠文王书：秦之上郡，近扞关至于榆中者，千五...","context_before":"榆溪塞[在废胜州北。《战国策》：","source_end_index":55,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"87fb7b37-661f-5d2f-b742-558b0b2c5a64","source_start_index":16,"source_text":"赵武灵王胡服率骑入胡，出于遗遗之门，逾九限之固，绝五径之险，至榆中，辟地千里。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"2趙王略中山地，至寧葭；西略胡地，至榆中。林胡王獻馬，歸，使樓緩之秦，仇液之韓，王賁之楚，富丁之魏，趙爵之齊；代相趙固主胡，致其兵。","content_fanyi":"赵武灵王攻取中山国土地，到达宁葭；又向西攻取胡人土地，到达榆中。林胡王向赵王进献马匹。赵武灵王回到赵国后，派楼缓前往秦国，仇液前往韩国，王贲前往楚国，富丁前往魏国，赵爵前往齐国，分别开展外交；又派代郡相赵固驻守胡地，招收胡兵。","content_jianti_auto":"2赵王略中山地，至宁葭；西略胡地，至榆中。林胡王献马，归，使楼缓之秦，仇液之韩，王贲之楚，富丁之魏，赵爵之齐；代相赵固主胡，致其兵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":271,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c7cd9f0-db0e-11ef-98c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c7f2dd0-db0e-11ef-bda4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c7f2dd1-db0e-11ef-b8fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c7f2dd2-db0e-11ef-a568-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c7f2dd3-db0e-11ef-8498-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c7f2dd4-db0e-11ef-83a7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":